# Nothing in this repository is generated, and nothing in it is secret.
#
# These entries exist to catch the two ways that could accidentally change: a
# credential file created in the wrong place, or an editor/tool dropping state
# into a directory that gets committed.

# Never commit a real credential file, wherever someone puts one.
secrets/
*.secret
*.key
!herdr/scripts/herdr-agy.sh

# Installer output and backups, in case someone runs the scripts from the repo.
*.bak-yellowstone-*
*.tmp

# A generated inventory of THIS machine's skills and themes. Useful locally,
# never ship it: it lists skills for private projects and names absolute paths.
# Regenerate with the description in docs/testing.md.
agent-skills.md

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Node, if anyone runs a tool here
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
